        "original_id": "c7bbad29-f8d2-5b86-a76d-b0a06faec541",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David W. Anderson\n- Companies: Famous Dave's\n- Organizations: U.S. Department of the Interior, Bureau of Indian Affairs, Office of Indian Education Programs, Bureau of Indian Education\n- Roles: Assistant Secretary - Indian Affairs\n\nFacts:\n- David W. Anderson founded the Famous Dave's restaurant chain.\n- David W. Anderson served as Assistant Secretary - Indian Affairs in the U.S. Department of the Interior.\n- The Assistant Secretary - Indian Affairs role had jurisdiction over the Bureau of Indian Affairs and the Office of Indian Education Programs, which is now the Bureau of Indian Education.\n- As of 2016, Famous Dave's had 170 locations in 34 U.S. states.",
